WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.428
At Dometic Tidaholm, every shift needs a clear picture of
production.

2
00:00:06.012 --> 00:00:09.308
RTM three point zero brings that picture together.

3
00:00:09.899 --> 00:00:18.848
Real Time Management gives operators, team leaders,
technicians and engineers a shared view, on factory
screens, computers and phones.

4
00:00:19.428 --> 00:00:25.483
In daily and shift meetings, teams review performance,
check production plans and agree on actions.

5
00:00:26.057 --> 00:00:30.367
Filters let them focus on the right process, flow, shift
and date.

6
00:00:30.957 --> 00:00:36.718
Production views bring output, targets, staffing, downtime
and changeovers into focus.

7
00:00:37.353 --> 00:00:41.325
Teams can compare shifts and see how performance develops
over time.

8
00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:44.940
Safety and quality are part of the same conversation.

9
00:00:45.437 --> 00:00:51.530
Follow observations, risks and incidents, alongside scrap
quantities, costs and reasons.

10
00:00:52.161 --> 00:00:58.433
Planning connects today's work with what comes next:
orders, materials, capacity and deliveries.

11
00:00:59.035 --> 00:01:05.012
In Factory forty-three, teams can follow started orders
and remaining quantities at each gluing wheel.

12
00:01:05.592 --> 00:01:12.993
Flow views reveal lead times and work in progress, helping
teams identify queues and see where material accumulates.

13
00:01:13.581 --> 00:01:15.853
Standard work stays close to production.

14
00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:26.398
Maintenance priorities, five-S results and improvement
actions help turn observations into practical next steps,
with owners, status and completion dates.

15
00:01:27.009 --> 00:01:33.263
Behind the views, information comes from the ERP system,
machine data and input from production.

16
00:01:33.845 --> 00:01:38.494
Power Apps support material handling, tool registration
and communication.

17
00:01:39.068 --> 00:01:44.668
And the Dometic App Portal puts practical Lean, ergonomic
and process tools within reach.

18
00:01:45.275 --> 00:01:47.001
RTM three point zero.

19
00:01:47.444 --> 00:01:48.455
A shared picture.

20
00:01:48.889 --> 00:01:49.997
Clear priorities.

21
00:01:50.456 --> 00:01:53.760
Better conversations, from one shift to the next.

